# Lean / Lake
# Applied repo-wide rather than per package: `backends/lean/.gitignore` and
# `tests/lean/.gitignore` only cover the packages that existed when they were
# written, so every new Lake package silently reintroduced ~700MB of artifacts.
.lake/
build/
lake-packages/
*.olean
*.ilean
*.trace
